Well, there's no option to change water's glyph specifically, but 
unless UnNethack changed the "dungeon" option (you'd have to ask Patric 
Mueller himself), you could use something like:

  OPTIONS=dungeon: |--------||.-|++##.##<><>_|\\#{}.}..## #}

If you just want to change water, you're looking for the first '}' in 
that string of symbols. For more details, you can look at the wiki 
entry: http://nethack.wikia.com/wiki/Options#dungeon

Side note: yes, that space is part of the string of symbols, not just 
whitespace.

